[
  {
    "id": 7010001030010,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "プロ、プロデューサーさん、\r\nど、ど、ど、どうでしたか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "bg": "00002",
    "bgm": "006",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "落ち着け、智代子\r\n二次審査は、無事に通ったぞ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030020,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "ほ、本当ですか！　間違いありませんか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あぁ。よかったな。俺も嬉しいよ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030030,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "や……やったー！\r\n嬉しい！　すっごく嬉しいです！！",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おいおい、はしゃぎすぎだ\r\n下の階に響くから、少し落ち着いてくれ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030040,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "だって、二次審査突破ですよ！？\r\n嬉しいじゃないですか！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030040"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030050,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "やっぱりこれって、テレビに出たからですよね！\r\nバラエティ番組って偉大です！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030050"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030060,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あの番組に出てから、ツイスタ見てくれる人、\r\nすっごく増えましたもん！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030060"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030070,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "もう、ぐーっと！\r\nケタが変わりました！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……たしかに、\r\nきっかけはバラエティへの出演だったのかもしれない",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "でもそれは、出演したからってだけじゃなくて、\r\n出演して智代子が頑張ったからこそだ",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030080,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "そうですかね、そうなんでしょうか？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、間違いない",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030090,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "えへへ……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030090"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030100,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "――あっ、そうだ、ツイスタのみんなに報告しなきゃ！\r\n『みんなのおかげで通過しましたー』って！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030100"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030110,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "せっかくだからお礼と一緒に\r\n自撮りも付けようかな……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030110"
  },
  {
    "id": 7010001030120,
    "speaker": "智代子",
    "text": "あっ、でも今制服だし、着替えたほうがいいかな！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/701000103/7010001030120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（あんなに緊張していたのに、今はもう、\r\nすごく楽しそうだ）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "（本当に、通過してよかったな……！）",
    "charLabel": "chiyoko",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "label": "end"
  }
]